+# TrustLens — a second look, before you act
+
+A local family-safety prototype for suspicious messages, screenshots, links, emails, call transcripts and images. It explains the evidence, suggests an independent verification step and provides a recovery checklist if someone already acted. It does not declare people scammers or guarantee safety.
